        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(cold, evocation, primal)\n\nThe fjord linnorm expels a 120-foot line of icy bile, dealing 17d6 cold damage to creatures within the area (37 basic Reflex save)\n\nAny creature that fails its save is covered by the ice, which freezes and fuses with the creature's skin, giving it a \u201310-foot penalty to Speed. A creature can Escape or Force Open the ice (34) to free itself; otherwise, the ice remains for 1 minute. The fjord linnorm can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds."
            },
